<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Pt0.A1.SS1" title="In Appendix 0.A Appendix A: Methodological Specifications ‣ MeVe: A Modular System for Memory Verification and Effective Context Control in Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">0.A.1 </span>Technical Framework and Software Infrastructure</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Pt0.A1.SS2" title="In Appendix 0.A Appendix A: Methodological Specifications ‣ MeVe: A Modular System for Memory Verification and Effective Context Control in Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">0.A.2 </span>Models utilized</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Pt0.A1.SS3" title="In Appendix 0.A Appendix A: Methodological Specifications ‣ MeVe: A Modular System for Memory Verification and Effective Context Control in Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">0.A.3 </span>Corpus Details</span></a></li>
